Liu-Su-Li's Eq. 120 corridor landscape, on a circuit: walk vs SGD.
Exact sweep at d=3 (numpy); ONE circuit at d=2 to verify the
circuit reproduces it. Building a 12-qubit DiagonalGate 16 times
per configuration was the bottleneck - 4096 multiplexed rotations
each - and none of it is needed to get the physics.

